[2026-03-14T21:51:28.366Z] {"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_019eLfDsZkowUxn3mthV1TzQ","type":"tool_result","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Perfect! Now I have all the information I need. Let me compile a comprehensive exploration report:\n\n## Linear Clone App Exploration Report\n\n### 1. APP DIRECTORY NAME\n**/repo/apps/LinearClone**\n\n---\n\n### 2. TEAM ISSUES PAGE COMPONENT & FILTER-RELATED COMPONENTS\n\n#### Team Issues Page\n- **File**: `/repo/apps/LinearClone/src/pages/TeamIssues.tsx`\n- **Purpose**: Main page for viewing all issues in a team\n- **Key Features**:\n  - Displays team issues grouped by status (default)\n  - Shows team name in header with \"Issues\" title\n  - Has \"New Issue\" button\n  - Integrates filters, group/sort controls, bulk actions, and issue list\n\n#### Filter Components\n\n**TeamFilters.tsx** (`/repo/apps/LinearClone/src/components/TeamFilters.tsx`)\n- Multi-filter dropdown component for Team Issues page\n- **Filter Types** (all 6 required filters supported):\n  1. **Status** - backlog, todo, in_progress, in_review, done, cancelled\n  2. **Priority** - urgent, high, medium, low, none\n  3. **Assignee** - includes \"unassigned\" option plus team members\n  4. **Label** - dynamic list from database\n  5. **Project** - includes \"No Project\" option plus actual projects\n  6. **Cycle** - includes \"No Cycle\" option plus team cycles\n- Features: Dropdown UI with checkboxes, badge counts when filters applied, click-outside close\n\n**FiltersToolbar.tsx** (`/repo/apps/LinearClone/src/components/FiltersToolbar.tsx`)\n- Simplified filter component for My Issues page (only Status, Priority, Label)\n- Same UI pattern as TeamFilters but fewer options\n\n**GroupBySort.tsx** (`/repo/apps/LinearClone/src/components/GroupBySort.tsx`)\n- Controls issue grouping and sorting\n- **Group By Options**: status, priority, assignee, project, label, none (default: status)\n- **Sort By Options**: priority, created, updated, status (default: priority)\n\n---\n\n### 3. TEST SPEC DOCUMENTATION\n**File**: `/repo/apps/LinearClone/docs/tests.md`\n- Comprehensive test specification document (48,070 tokens - very detailed)\n- Covers all pages and components including:\n  - Login/Signup pages\n  - My Issues and Team Issues pages\n  - Filters and grouping\n  - Bulk actions\n  - Issue details\n  - And more...\n- Format: Detailed test specifications with Initial State, Action, and Expected results\n\n---\n\n### 4. EXISTING TEST FILES FOR REFERENCE\n\nKey test files in `/repo/apps/LinearClone/tests/`:\n\n| Test File | Purpose |\n|-----------|---------|\n| `team-issues.spec.ts` | Team Issues page rendering, grouping, empty states, collapse toggle |\n| `team-issues-row.spec.ts` | Issue row display, status changing, priority/label display, assignees |\n| `team-issues-bulk-actions.spec.ts` | Bulk selection and bulk updates |\n| `team-issues-create.spec.ts` | Creating new issues |\n| `my-issues.spec.ts` | My Issues page (assigned only) |\n| `my-issues-filters.spec.ts` | Filter functionality on My Issues |\n| `my-issues-row.spec.ts` | Issue row behavior on My Issues |\n| `group-by-sort-group.spec.ts` | Grouping functionality |\n| `group-by-sort-sort.spec.ts` | Sorting functionality |\n| `login.spec.ts`, `signup.spec.ts` | Authentication |\n| `inbox-list.spec.ts`, `notification-row.spec.ts` | Notifications |\n| `sidebar.spec.ts`, `keyboard-shortcuts.spec.ts` | Navigation |\n\n**Pattern**: All use helper functions (`loginViaApi`, `getTeams`, `getTeamIssues`) to set up state and navigate\n\n---\n\n### 5. SEED DATA FILE\n**File**: `/repo/apps/LinearClone/scripts/seed-db.ts`\n\n**Seed Data Structure**:\n- **Workspace**: \"Acme Corp\"\n- **Members** (3):\n  - Alice Johnson (alice@acme.com, role: admin)\n  - Bob Smith (bob@acme.com, role: member)\n  - Carol Davis (carol@acme.com, role: member)\n- **Teams** (2):\n  - Engineering (ENG) - has Alice, Bob, Carol\n  - Design (DES) - has Alice, Carol\n- **Labels** (4):\n  - Bug (#ef4444 - red)\n  - Feature (#22c55e - green)\n  - Improvement (#3b82f6 - blue)\n  - Documentation (#a855f7 - purple)\n- **Projects** (1):\n  - V2 Launch (in_progress, lead: Alice)\n- **Cycles** (1):\n  - Sprint 12 (active, for ENG team)\n- **Issues** (ENG team - 8 issues):\n  - ENG-1: in_progress, high, Bug, assigned to Alice, in V2 Launch, in Sprint 12\n  - ENG-2: todo, medium, Feature, assigned to Bob, in V2 Launch, in Sprint 12\n  - ENG-3: backlog, low, Feature, unassigned, in V2 Launch, in Sprint 12\n  - ENG-4: in_review, high, Improvement, assigned to Carol, in V2 Launch, in Sprint 12\n  - ENG-5: done, medium, Documentation, assigned to Bob, no project, no cycle\n  - ENG-6: todo, urgent, Bug, assigned to Alice, in V2 Launch, in Sprint 12\n  - ENG-7: backlog, none, Improvement, unassigned, no project, no cycle\n  - ENG-8: in_progress, medium, Feature, assigned to Bob, in V2 Launch, in Sprint 12\n- **Issues** (DES team - 3 issues):\n  - DES-1: in_progress, medium, Improvement, assigned to Carol, in V2 Launch\n  - DES-2: done, high, Feature, assigned to Carol\n  - DES-3: todo, low, Improvement, assigned to Alice, in V2 Launch\n\n---\n\n### 6. NETLIFY FUNCTIONS FOR ISSUES/TEAMS\n\n**Location**: `/repo/apps/LinearClone/netlify/functions/`\n\n**Team/Issues Related Functions**:\n\n| Function | Purpose | Key Features |\n|----------|---------|--------------|\n| `team-issues.ts` | GET /api/team-issues - Fetch all issues for a team | Returns issues with labels, members, projects, cycles for filters |\n| `teams.ts` | GET/POST /api/teams - List teams or create new team | - |\n| `team-members.ts` | GET /api/team-members - Get members in a team | - |\n| `my-issues.ts` | GET /api/my-issues - Fetch issues assigned to current user | - |\n| `create-issue.ts` | POST /api/create-issue - Create new issue | - |\n| `update-issue.ts` | PUT /api/update-issue - Update issue properties | - |\n| `update-issue-status.ts` | PUT /api/update-issue-status - Change issue status | Specific endpoint for status changes |\n| `bulk-update-issues.ts` | PUT /api/bulk-update-issues - Update multiple issues at once | Supports status, priority, assigneeId, labelId |\n| `issue-detail.ts` | GET /api/issue-detail - Get single issue with all details | - |\n| `cycles.ts` | GET /api/cycles - List cycles | - |\n| `cycle-issues.ts` | GET /api/cycle-issues - Get issues in a cycle | - |\n| `projects.ts` | GET /api/projects - List projects | - |\n| `labels.ts` | GET /api/labels - Get all labels | - |\n\n**Key Function: team-issues.ts**\n- Validates Bearer token authorization\n- Requires `teamId` query parameter\n- Returns:\n  ```typescript\n  {\n    issues: TeamIssue[],\n    members: TeamMember[],\n    projects: TeamProject[],\n    cycles: TeamCycle[]\n  }\n  ```\n- Issues include: title, status, priority, assignee info, project info, cycle info, labels\n\n---\n\n### 7. PLAYWRIGHT CONFIG\n**File**: `/repo/apps/LinearClone/playwright.config.ts`\n\n**Configuration**:\n```typescript\n- Test directory: ./tests\n- Timeout: 60 seconds per test, 10 seconds for expect\n- Parallel execution: fully parallel (fullyParallel: true)\n- Retries: 0 (no retries)\n- Reporters:\n  - Replay IO (replay reporter)\n  - JSON output (test-results/results.json)\n  - HTML report (never open automatically)\n- Base URL: http://localhost:8888\n- Uses Replay Chromium devices for recording\n- Action timeout: 15 seconds\n```\n\n---\n\n### 8. FILTER UI COMPONENTS - DETAILED ANALYSIS\n\n#### Status Filter\n- **Values**: backlog, todo, in_progress, in_review, done, cancelled\n- **Display**: Status icons (SVG) + label text\n- **Icons**: Visual representations (dashed circle, empty circle, progress circle, etc.)\n- **Used in**: TeamFilters, FiltersToolbar, BulkActions, IssueRow status dropdown\n\n#### Priority Filter\n- **Values**: urgent, high, medium, low, none\n- **Display**: Priority icons (SVG) + label text\n- **Icons**: Triangle (urgent), up arrow (high), dash (medium), down arrow (low), dots (none)\n- **Used in**: TeamFilters, FiltersToolbar, BulkActions, IssueRow\n\n#### Assignee Filter\n- **Values**: unassigned + team members\n- **Display**: Avatar (initials or \"?\" for unassigned) + name\n- **Avatar Style**: 2-letter initials in colored circle, or \"?\" for unassigned\n- **Used in**: TeamFilters, BulkActions\n\n#### Label Filter\n- **Values**: All labels from database\n- **Display**: Colored dot + label name\n- **Colors**: From database (red, green, blue, purple examples)\n- **Used in**: TeamFilters, FiltersToolbar, BulkActions\n\n#### Project Filter\n- **Values**: \"No Project\" + actual projects\n- **Display**: Project name only\n- **Icon**: Folder icon\n- **Used in**: TeamFilters (Team Issues only, not in My Issues)\n\n#### Cycle Filter\n- **Values**: \"No Cycle\" + team cycles\n- **Display**: Cycle name\n- **Used in**: TeamFilters (Team Issues only, not in My Issues)\n\n---\n\n### 9. DATA MODEL SUMMARY\n\n#### Core Entities\n\n**Issue**:\n```typescript\ninterface TeamIssue {\n  id: string;\n  title: string;\n  description?: string;\n  status: 'backlog' | 'todo' | 'in_progress' | 'in_review' | 'done' | 'cancelled';\n  priority: 'urgent' | 'high' | 'medium' | 'low' | 'none';\n  identifier: string; // e.g., \"ENG-1\"\n  number: number;\n  teamId: string;\n  assigneeId?: string | null;\n  assigneeName?: string;\n  assigneeEmail?: string;\n  projectId?: string | null;\n  projectName?: string;\n  cycleId?: string | null;\n  cycleName?: string;\n  dueDate?: string | null;\n  createdAt: string;\n  updatedAt: string;\n  labels: Array<{ id: string; name: string; color: string }>;\n}\n```\n\n**Member**:\n```typescript\ninterface TeamMember {\n  id: string;\n  name: string;\n  email: string;\n}\n```\n\n**Project**:\n```typescript\ninterface TeamProject {\n  id: string;\n  name: string;\n}\n```\n\n**Cycle**:\n```typescript\ninterface TeamCycle {\n  id: string;\n  name: string;\n  start_date: string;\n  end_date: string;\n}\n```\n\n#### Redux State (teamIssuesSlice)\n```typescript\ninterface TeamIssuesState {\n  items: TeamIssue[];\n  members: TeamMember[];\n  projects: TeamProject[];\n  cycles: TeamCycle[];\n  loading: boolean;\n  error: string | null;\n  selectedIds: string[];\n  groupBy: 'status' | 'priority' | 'assignee' | 'project' | 'label' | 'none';\n  sortBy: 'priority' | 'created' | 'updated' | 'status';\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n### 10. KEY PATTERNS & CONVENTIONS\n\n**Filter Handling**:\n- Filters stored in component state (not Redux)\n- Multiple selections supported for each filter type\n- Filters applied locally via useMemo for client-side filtering\n- Filter state passed as separate arrays (selectedStatuses, selectedPriorities, etc.)\n\n**Group/Sort**:\n- Group and sort state stored in Redux\n- Default: group by status, sort by priority\n- Dynamic grouping with collapsible sections\n- Group headers show count and icons\n\n**Test Patterns**:\n- Login via API, set localStorage token, navigate\n- Use getTeams and getTeamIssues helpers to fetch data\n- Use data-testid attributes extensively\n- Check counts, visibility, text content, and positioning\n\n**API Patterns**:\n- Bearer token authorization header\n- All endpoints require authentication\n- Query parameters for filters/options\n- JSON request/response bodies\n\n---\n\n### FILE PATHS SUMMARY\n\n| Component/File | Path |\n|---|---|\n| Team Issues Page | `/repo/apps/LinearClone/src/pages/TeamIssues.tsx` |\n| TeamFilters Component | `/repo/apps/LinearClone/src/components/TeamFilters.tsx` |\n| FiltersToolbar Component | `/repo/apps/LinearClone/src/components/FiltersToolbar.tsx` |\n| GroupBySort Component | `/repo/apps/LinearClone/src/components/GroupBySort.tsx` |\n| IssueRow Component | `/repo/apps/LinearClone/src/components/IssueRow.tsx` |\n| TeamIssuesList Component | `/repo/apps/LinearClone/src/components/TeamIssuesList.tsx` |\n| BulkActions Component | `/repo/apps/LinearClone/src/components/BulkActions.tsx` |\n| Redux Slice | `/repo/apps/LinearClone/src/slices/teamIssuesSlice.ts` |\n| Test Docs | `/repo/apps/LinearClone/docs/tests.md` |\n| Seed Data | `/repo/apps/LinearClone/scripts/seed-db.ts` |\n| Schema | `/repo/apps/LinearClone/scripts/schema.ts` |\n| Team Issues API | `/repo/apps/LinearClone/netlify/functions/team-issues.ts` |\n| Playwright Config | `/repo/apps/LinearClone/playwright.config.ts` |\n| Test Files | `/repo/apps/LinearClone/tests/` |"},{"type":"text","text":"agentId: a20a4bec80800214e (for resuming to continue this agent's work if needed)\n<usage>total_tokens: 75540\ntool_uses: 31\nduration_ms: 55602</usage>"}]}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"4a000f0f-5f88-4afd-a2db-f037dfcb70b7","uuid":"65361214-175a-423d-94f5-393ef61048e6","tool_use_result":{"status":"completed","prompt":"Explore the linear clone app in /repo/apps/. Find:\n1. The app directory name\n2. The team issues page component and any filter-related components\n3. The test spec/docs for tests (docs/tests.md)\n4. Existing test files for reference\n5. The seed data file\n6. Netlify functions related to issues/teams\n7. The playwright config\n\nBe very thorough - I need to understand the filter UI components, what filter options exist (status, priority, assignee, label, project, cycle), and the data model.","agentId":"a20a4bec80800214e","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Perfect! Now I have all the information I need. Let me compile a comprehensive exploration report:\n\n## Linear Clone App Exploration Report\n\n### 1. APP DIRECTORY NAME\n**/repo/apps/LinearClone**\n\n---\n\n### 2. TEAM ISSUES PAGE COMPONENT & FILTER-RELATED COMPONENTS\n\n#### Team Issues Page\n- **File**: `/repo/apps/LinearClone/src/pages/TeamIssues.tsx`\n- **Purpose**: Main page for viewing all issues in a team\n- **Key Features**:\n  - Displays team issues grouped by status (default)\n  - Shows team name in header with \"Issues\" title\n  - Has \"New Issue\" button\n  - Integrates filters, group/sort controls, bulk actions, and issue list\n\n#### Filter Components\n\n**TeamFilters.tsx** (`/repo/apps/LinearClone/src/components/TeamFilters.tsx`)\n- Multi-filter dropdown component for Team Issues page\n- **Filter Types** (all 6 required filters supported):\n  1. **Status** - backlog, todo, in_progress, in_review, done, cancelled\n  2. **Priority** - urgent, high, medium, low, none\n  3. **Assignee** - includes \"unassigned\" option plus team members\n  4. **Label** - dynamic list from database\n  5. **Project** - includes \"No Project\" option plus actual projects\n  6. **Cycle** - includes \"No Cycle\" option plus team cycles\n- Features: Dropdown UI with checkboxes, badge counts when filters applied, click-outside close\n\n**FiltersToolbar.tsx** (`/repo/apps/LinearClone/src/components/FiltersToolbar.tsx`)\n- Simplified filter component for My Issues page (only Status, Priority, Label)\n- Same UI pattern as TeamFilters but fewer options\n\n**GroupBySort.tsx** (`/repo/apps/LinearClone/src/components/GroupBySort.tsx`)\n- Controls issue grouping and sorting\n- **Group By Options**: status, priority, assignee, project, label, none (default: status)\n- **Sort By Options**: priority, created, updated, status (default: priority)\n\n---\n\n### 3. TEST SPEC DOCUMENTATION\n**File**: `/repo/apps/LinearClone/docs/tests.md`\n- Comprehensive test specification document (48,070 tokens - very detailed)\n- Covers all pages and components including:\n  - Login/Signup pages\n  - My Issues and Team Issues pages\n  - Filters and grouping\n  - Bulk actions\n  - Issue details\n  - And more...\n- Format: Detailed test specifications with Initial State, Action, and Expected results\n\n---\n\n### 4. EXISTING TEST FILES FOR REFERENCE\n\nKey test files in `/repo/apps/LinearClone/tests/`:\n\n| Test File | Purpose |\n|-----------|---------|\n| `team-issues.spec.ts` | Team Issues page rendering, grouping, empty states, collapse toggle |\n| `team-issues-row.spec.ts` | Issue row display, status changing, priority/label display, assignees |\n| `team-issues-bulk-actions.spec.ts` | Bulk selection and bulk updates |\n| `team-issues-create.spec.ts` | Creating new issues |\n| `my-issues.spec.ts` | My Issues page (assigned only) |\n| `my-issues-filters.spec.ts` | Filter functionality on My Issues |\n| `my-issues-row.spec.ts` | Issue row behavior on My Issues |\n| `group-by-sort-group.spec.ts` | Grouping functionality |\n| `group-by-sort-sort.spec.ts` | Sorting functionality |\n| `login.spec.ts`, `signup.spec.ts` | Authentication |\n| `inbox-list.spec.ts`, `notification-row.spec.ts` | Notifications |\n| `sidebar.spec.ts`, `keyboard-shortcuts.spec.ts` | Navigation |\n\n**Pattern**: All use helper functions (`loginViaApi`, `getTeams`, `getTeamIssues`) to set up state and navigate\n\n---\n\n### 5. SEED DATA FILE\n**File**: `/repo/apps/LinearClone/scripts/seed-db.ts`\n\n**Seed Data Structure**:\n- **Workspace**: \"Acme Corp\"\n- **Members** (3):\n  - Alice Johnson (alice@acme.com, role: admin)\n  - Bob Smith (bob@acme.com, role: member)\n  - Carol Davis (carol@acme.com, role: member)\n- **Teams** (2):\n  - Engineering (ENG) - has Alice, Bob, Carol\n  - Design (DES) - has Alice, Carol\n- **Labels** (4):\n  - Bug (#ef4444 - red)\n  - Feature (#22c55e - green)\n  - Improvement (#3b82f6 - blue)\n  - Documentation (#a855f7 - purple)\n- **Projects** (1):\n  - V2 Launch (in_progress, lead: Alice)\n- **Cycles** (1):\n  - Sprint 12 (active, for ENG team)\n- **Issues** (ENG team - 8 issues):\n  - ENG-1: in_progress, high, Bug, assigned to Alice, in V2 Launch, in Sprint 12\n  - ENG-2: todo, medium, Feature, assigned to Bob, in V2 Launch, in Sprint 12\n  - ENG-3: backlog, low, Feature, unassigned, in V2 Launch, in Sprint 12\n  - ENG-4: in_review, high, Improvement, assigned to Carol, in V2 Launch, in Sprint 12\n  - ENG-5: done, medium, Documentation, assigned to Bob, no project, no cycle\n  - ENG-6: todo, urgent, Bug, assigned to Alice, in V2 Launch, in Sprint 12\n  - ENG-7: backlog, none, Improvement, unassigned, no project, no cycle\n  - ENG-8: in_progress, medium, Feature, assigned to Bob, in V2 Launch, in Sprint 12\n- **Issues** (DES team - 3 issues):\n  - DES-1: in_progress, medium, Improvement, assigned to Carol, in V2 Launch\n  - DES-2: done, high, Feature, assigned to Carol\n  - DES-3: todo, low, Improvement, assigned to Alice, in V2 Launch\n\n---\n\n### 6. NETLIFY FUNCTIONS FOR ISSUES/TEAMS\n\n**Location**: `/repo/apps/LinearClone/netlify/functions/`\n\n**Team/Issues Related Functions**:\n\n| Function | Purpose | Key Features |\n|----------|---------|--------------|\n| `team-issues.ts` | GET /api/team-issues - Fetch all issues for a team | Returns issues with labels, members, projects, cycles for filters |\n| `teams.ts` | GET/POST /api/teams - List teams or create new team | - |\n| `team-members.ts` | GET /api/team-members - Get members in a team | - |\n| `my-issues.ts` | GET /api/my-issues - Fetch issues assigned to current user | - |\n| `create-issue.ts` | POST /api/create-issue - Create new issue | - |\n| `update-issue.ts` | PUT /api/update-issue - Update issue properties | - |\n| `update-issue-status.ts` | PUT /api/update-issue-status - Change issue status | Specific endpoint for status changes |\n| `bulk-update-issues.ts` | PUT /api/bulk-update-issues - Update multiple issues at once | Supports status, priority, assigneeId, labelId |\n| `issue-detail.ts` | GET /api/issue-detail - Get single issue with all details | - |\n| `cycles.ts` | GET /api/cycles - List cycles | - |\n| `cycle-issues.ts` | GET /api/cycle-issues - Get issues in a cycle | - |\n| `projects.ts` | GET /api/projects - List projects | - |\n| `labels.ts` | GET /api/labels - Get all labels | - |\n\n**Key Function: team-issues.ts**\n- Validates Bearer token authorization\n- Requires `teamId` query parameter\n- Returns:\n  ```typescript\n  {\n    issues: TeamIssue[],\n    members: TeamMember[],\n    projects: TeamProject[],\n    cycles: TeamCycle[]\n  }\n  ```\n- Issues include: title, status, priority, assignee info, project info, cycle info, labels\n\n---\n\n### 7. PLAYWRIGHT CONFIG\n**File**: `/repo/apps/LinearClone/playwright.config.ts`\n\n**Configuration**:\n```typescript\n- Test directory: ./tests\n- Timeout: 60 seconds per test, 10 seconds for expect\n- Parallel execution: fully parallel (fullyParallel: true)\n- Retries: 0 (no retries)\n- Reporters:\n  - Replay IO (replay reporter)\n  - JSON output (test-results/results.json)\n  - HTML report (never open automatically)\n- Base URL: http://localhost:8888\n- Uses Replay Chromium devices for recording\n- Action timeout: 15 seconds\n```\n\n---\n\n### 8. FILTER UI COMPONENTS - DETAILED ANALYSIS\n\n#### Status Filter\n- **Values**: backlog, todo, in_progress, in_review, done, cancelled\n- **Display**: Status icons (SVG) + label text\n- **Icons**: Visual representations (dashed circle, empty circle, progress circle, etc.)\n- **Used in**: TeamFilters, FiltersToolbar, BulkActions, IssueRow status dropdown\n\n#### Priority Filter\n- **Values**: urgent, high, medium, low, none\n- **Display**: Priority icons (SVG) + label text\n- **Icons**: Triangle (urgent), up arrow (high), dash (medium), down arrow (low), dots (none)\n- **Used in**: TeamFilters, FiltersToolbar, BulkActions, IssueRow\n\n#### Assignee Filter\n- **Values**: unassigned + team members\n- **Display**: Avatar (initials or \"?\" for unassigned) + name\n- **Avatar Style**: 2-letter initials in colored circle, or \"?\" for unassigned\n- **Used in**: TeamFilters, BulkActions\n\n#### Label Filter\n- **Values**: All labels from database\n- **Display**: Colored dot + label name\n- **Colors**: From database (red, green, blue, purple examples)\n- **Used in**: TeamFilters, FiltersToolbar, BulkActions\n\n#### Project Filter\n- **Values**: \"No Project\" + actual projects\n- **Display**: Project name only\n- **Icon**: Folder icon\n- **Used in**: TeamFilters (Team Issues only, not in My Issues)\n\n#### Cycle Filter\n- **Values**: \"No Cycle\" + team cycles\n- **Display**: Cycle name\n- **Used in**: TeamFilters (Team Issues only, not in My Issues)\n\n---\n\n### 9. DATA MODEL SUMMARY\n\n#### Core Entities\n\n**Issue**:\n```typescript\ninterface TeamIssue {\n  id: string;\n  title: string;\n  description?: string;\n  status: 'backlog' | 'todo' | 'in_progress' | 'in_review' | 'done' | 'cancelled';\n  priority: 'urgent' | 'high' | 'medium' | 'low' | 'none';\n  identifier: string; // e.g., \"ENG-1\"\n  number: number;\n  teamId: string;\n  assigneeId?: string | null;\n  assigneeName?: string;\n  assigneeEmail?: string;\n  projectId?: string | null;\n  projectName?: string;\n  cycleId?: string | null;\n  cycleName?: string;\n  dueDate?: string | null;\n  createdAt: string;\n  updatedAt: string;\n  labels: Array<{ id: string; name: string; color: string }>;\n}\n```\n\n**Member**:\n```typescript\ninterface TeamMember {\n  id: string;\n  name: string;\n  email: string;\n}\n```\n\n**Project**:\n```typescript\ninterface TeamProject {\n  id: string;\n  name: string;\n}\n```\n\n**Cycle**:\n```typescript\ninterface TeamCycle {\n  id: string;\n  name: string;\n  start_date: string;\n  end_date: string;\n}\n```\n\n#### Redux State (teamIssuesSlice)\n```typescript\ninterface TeamIssuesState {\n  items: TeamIssue[];\n  members: TeamMember[];\n  projects: TeamProject[];\n  cycles: TeamCycle[];\n  loading: boolean;\n  error: string | null;\n  selectedIds: string[];\n  groupBy: 'status' | 'priority' | 'assignee' | 'project' | 'label' | 'none';\n  sortBy: 'priority' | 'created' | 'updated' | 'status';\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n### 10. KEY PATTERNS & CONVENTIONS\n\n**Filter Handling**:\n- Filters stored in component state (not Redux)\n- Multiple selections supported for each filter type\n- Filters applied locally via useMemo for client-side filtering\n- Filter state passed as separate arrays (selectedStatuses, selectedPriorities, etc.)\n\n**Group/Sort**:\n- Group and sort state stored in Redux\n- Default: group by status, sort by priority\n- Dynamic grouping with collapsible sections\n- Group headers show count and icons\n\n**Test Patterns**:\n- Login via API, set localStorage token, navigate\n- Use getTeams and getTeamIssues helpers to fetch data\n- Use data-testid attributes extensively\n- Check counts, visibility, text content, and positioning\n\n**API Patterns**:\n- Bearer token authorization header\n- All endpoints require authentication\n- Query parameters for filters/options\n- JSON request/response bodies\n\n---\n\n### FILE PATHS SUMMARY\n\n| Component/File | Path |\n|---|---|\n| Team Issues Page | `/repo/apps/LinearClone/src/pages/TeamIssues.tsx` |\n| TeamFilters Component | `/repo/apps/LinearClone/src/components/TeamFilters.tsx` |\n| FiltersToolbar Component | `/repo/apps/LinearClone/src/components/FiltersToolbar.tsx` |\n| GroupBySort Component | `/repo/apps/LinearClone/src/components/GroupBySort.tsx` |\n| IssueRow Component | `/repo/apps/LinearClone/src/components/IssueRow.tsx` |\n| TeamIssuesList Component | `/repo/apps/LinearClone/src/components/TeamIssuesList.tsx` |\n| BulkActions Component | `/repo/apps/LinearClone/src/components/BulkActions.tsx` |\n| Redux Slice | `/repo/apps/LinearClone/src/slices/teamIssuesSlice.ts` |\n| Test Docs | `/repo/apps/LinearClone/docs/tests.md` |\n| Seed Data | `/repo/apps/LinearClone/scripts/seed-db.ts` |\n| Schema | `/repo/apps/LinearClone/scripts/schema.ts` |\n| Team Issues API | `/repo/apps/LinearClone/netlify/functions/team-issues.ts` |\n| Playwright Config | `/repo/apps/LinearClone/playwright.config.ts` |\n| Test Files | `/repo/apps/LinearClone/tests/` |"}],"totalDurationMs":55602,"totalTokens":75540,"totalToolUseCount":31,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1353,"cache_read_input_tokens":70455,"output_tokens":3731,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":1353},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[],"speed":"standard"}}}
